msgstr "Émettre une erreur"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1084
msgid "Halt"
msgstr "ARRET"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1091
msgid "Response Field Mapping"
msgstr "Mappage des champs de réponse"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1093
msgid "Map response values to WS Form fields. Response must be in JSON format."
msgstr ""
"Mapper les valeurs de réponse vers les champs WS Form. La réponse doit être "
"au format JSON."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1117
msgid "SSL Verify"
msgstr "Vérification SSL"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1119
msgid "Whether to verify SSL for the request."
msgstr "Indique s’il faut vérifier le SSL pour la requête."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1126
msgid "Use URLs for File Fields"
msgstr "Utiliser des URL pour les champs de fichiers"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1128
msgid ""
"If checked, file and signature fields will be converted to URLs instead of "
"file objects. Multiple files are comma separated."
msgstr ""
"Si cette case est cochée, les champs de fichier et de signature seront "
"convertis en URL au lieu d'objets de fichier. Les fichiers multiples sont "
"séparés par des virgules."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1135
msgid "Ignore Empty Values"
msgstr "Ignorer les valeurs vides"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1137
msgid ""
"If checked, keys with an empty value will not be included in the request."
msgstr ""
"Si coché, les clés dont la valeur est vide ne seront pas incluses dans la "
"requête."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1144
msgid "Convert Arrays to Delimited Text"
msgstr "Convertir des tableaux en texte délimité"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1146
msgid ""
"If checked, fields that have multiple values (e.g. Checkboxes) will be "
"converted to comma separated values."
msgstr ""
"Si cette case est cochée, les champs qui ont plusieurs valeurs (par exemple, "
"les cases à cocher) seront convertis en valeurs séparées par des virgules."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1153
msgid "Array Delimiter"
msgstr "Délimiteur de tableau"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1155
msgid "Enter a delimiter to use if an array is converted to delimited text."
msgstr ""
"Saisissez un délimiteur à utiliser si un tableau est converti en texte "
"délimité."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1174
msgid "Deduplicate Arrays"
msgstr "Dédupliquer les tableaux"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1176
msgid "If checked, multiple mappings to the same key will be deduplicated."
msgstr "Si coché, les mappages multiples vers la même clé seront dédupliqués."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1183
msgid "Cookie Passthrough"
msgstr "Transmission des cookies"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1185
msgid ""
"If checked, cookies will be passed from the form submission through to the "
"API request. Applies to same host requests only."
msgstr ""
"Si coché, les cookies seront transmis de l’envoi du formulaire à la requête "
"API. S’applique uniquement aux requêtes vers le même hôte."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1192
msgid "Repeaters to Arrays"
msgstr "Répéteurs vers tableaux"

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1194
msgid ""
"If checked, repeaters will be turned into arrays instead of being comma "
"separated. Applies to field mappings only."
msgstr ""
"Si coché, les répétiteurs seront convertis en tableaux au lieu d’être "
"séparés par des virgules. S’applique uniquement aux mappages de champs."

#: includes/actions/class-ws-form-action-custom-api.php:1211
msgid "Unknown status code"
msgstr "Code d'état inconnu"

